nable to live up to its potential."qDepending on its nature, a Pokémon may start using moves that don't match its nature when it is in trouble."HIf a Pokémon begins behaving oddly in a pinch, watch it carefully."!There is no battle recorded."$\bWelcome to the Battle Palace."8\bWould you like to participate in a single battle?"O\bDo you want to take the Level 50 challenge, or the Open Level challenge?"P\bSorry, you can't participate. You need three different Pokémon to enter."D\bThey must be of a different species and hold different items."?\bCertain exotic species, as well as eggs, are ineligible."8\bPlease choose the three Pokémon that will enter."\bPlease come this way."\bCome back another time."#\bCongratulations for winning."\bPlease take this prize."9\bYou have no room for it. At least you won, though."1\bWould you like to record your last battle?"/\se[Pkmn exp full]The battle was recorded.",Your results will be recorded.\wtnp[15]"\bThanks for playing."8\bWe've been waiting for you. Please come this way."P\bExcuse me, but you didn't save before finishing your challenge last time."3\bSorry, but your challenge has been canceled."8\bWould you like to participate in a double battle?"Level 50"Open Level"Cancel"Battle Palace rules"Play recorded battle"Yes"No[7@@@	@
